  "notes": "LRCGET: a lyrics-downloader desktop app. White canvas with no row dividers; rows are separated only by 52px rhythm. Hot pink #f35697 is the only brand color: primary pill CTA, search outline, player scrubber/volume, play button, and the row-button hover fill. Lyrics status chips are color-coded: Synced dark green with mint text, Word Synced an orange→pink→purple gradient, Instrumental gray, Plain near-black. Each row has three icon-only actions (play, search lyrics, edit lyrics) with no tooltips. Buttons are full pills (9999px radius), row icon buttons 4px radius, so corners are mixed. Tabs use an underline. LRCLIB is set apart by a vertical divider. The overflow menu holds Refresh library / Manage directories / Settings / About; About opens a modal (not in capture). The Albums tab replaces the table with album rows plus a download icon."
